l" href="'.e($detailUrl).'">查看订单详情</a></section><section class="result-card"><h2>交付遇到问题？</h2><p class="result-caption">请先刷新订单状态；如仍有问题，请携带订单号提交工单。</p><a class="result-outline" href="/tickets?order_id='.(int)$o['id'].'#new-ticket">联系支持</a></section></aside></div></div><script>(function(){var button=document.querySelector("[data-result-copy]");if(!button)return;button.addEventListener("click",function(){var text=document.getElementById("result-copy-value").textContent,status=document.querySelector(".result-copy-status");if(!navigator.clipboard){status.textContent="请展开交付内容后手动复制";return;}navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){status.textContent="已复制，请妥善保管";},function(){status.textContent="复制未完成，请展开内容后手动复制";});});})();</script>';
